# Outputs, not sources.  `runs/` is cheaserun.py's default --out and holds one
# .npz of psi( R, z ) per ( case, resolution ) at a couple of megabytes each --
# a 999^2 box is larger still.  The root .gitignore's `/runs/` is anchored on
# purpose and does not reach here, so this is the same rule tools/desc-benchmark
# states for itself.
runs/
